46
00:05:27,156 --> 00:05:32,363
[Host] A place where lots of old electronic devices gather is called an urban mine.

47
00:05:32,963 --> 00:05:35,627
[Vocab] 都市鉱山

48
00:05:36,028 --> 00:05:41,331
[Host] It means urban mine, the metals hidden inside discarded electronics.

49
00:05:41,932 --> 00:05:51,148
[Slow] この取り組みの背景には、資源を安定して手に入れたいという狙いがあります。

50
00:05:51,947 --> 00:05:56,459
